# Keep the deploy to exactly what the page loads.
#
# assets/ holds the full set of raw admin captures (~27 MB) as source material.
# They show real candidate names and email addresses, and a static host serves
# anything inside the deployed directory, so publishing them would expose every
# one of those screenshots to anyone who guesses the path. Only the cropped,
# blurred derivatives in assets/shots/ belong on a public URL.

assets/*
!assets/shots/
!assets/fonts/
!assets/brand/

# Source material and docs — no reason to ship them.
reference/
DESIGN.md
PROVENANCE.md
build-standalone.py
standalone.html
